msgid "夜班旅馆"
msgstr "Night Shift Hotel"

msgid "有人正在看着你，不能在这里更换身份。先离开对方视线。"
msgstr "Someone is watching. You cannot change identities here. Move out of sight first."

msgid "获得工作证：%s\n这张魔法工作证可以帮你伪装成酒店员工。\n先离开工作人员附近，再按 I 打开背包。"
msgstr "Work ID acquired: %s\nThis magic ID can disguise you as hotel staff.\nMove away from staff, then press I to open your bag."

msgid "现在安全了，可以尝试装备工作证。按 I 打开背包。"
msgstr "You are safe now. Try equipping the work ID. Press I to open your bag."

msgid "把工作证放入装备槽，就能使用对应的岗位身份。"
msgstr "Put the ID in an equipment slot to use that staff identity."

msgid "把新工作证放入装备槽A，就能使用对应的岗位身份。"
msgstr "Put the new ID in Slot A to use that staff identity."

msgid "把新工作证装备到这个槽"
msgstr "Equip the new ID in this slot"

msgid "工作证已装备。关闭背包后按 Q 启用对应身份。"
msgstr "The ID is equipped. Close your bag and press Q to activate it."

msgid "伪装成功！怪物现在会把你认作酒店员工。"
msgstr "Disguise complete! Monsters now recognize you as hotel staff."

msgid "不同身份可以执行不同工作，也能应对不同怪物检查。\n注意：不要在工作人员或怪物注视下切换身份。"
msgstr "Different identities qualify you for different jobs and monster checks.\nDo not switch while staff or a monster is watching."

